命，予大罰殛之，無有攸赦。」作湯征。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m004-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m004-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"葛伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000093","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m004-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m004-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m004-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m004-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p005","text":"伊尹名阿衡。阿衡欲奸湯而無由，乃為有莘氏媵臣，負鼎俎，以滋味說湯，致于王道。或曰，伊尹處士，湯使人聘迎之，五反，然後肯往從湯，言素王及九主之事。湯舉任以國政。伊尹去湯適夏。既醜有夏，復歸于亳。入自北門，遇女鳩、女房，作女鳩女房。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"阿衡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"阿衡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"有莘氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0061","start":61,"end":62,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"素王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"九主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0082","start":82,"end":83,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"女鳩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000095","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m005-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"女房","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000096","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p007","text":"當是時，夏桀為虐政淫荒，而諸侯昆吾氏為亂。湯乃興師率諸侯，伊尹從湯，湯自把鉞以伐昆吾，遂伐桀。湯曰：「格女眾庶，來，女悉聽朕言。匪台小子，敢行舉亂，有夏多罪，予維聞女眾言，夏氏有罪。予畏上帝，不敢不正。今夏多罪，天命殛之。今女有眾，女曰：『我君不恤我眾，舍我嗇事而割政』。女其曰：『有罪，其柰何』？夏王率止眾力，率奪夏國。有眾率怠不和，曰：『是日何時喪？予與女皆亡』！夏德若茲，今朕必往。爾尚及予一人致天之罰，予其大理女。女毋不信，朕不食言。女不從誓言，予則帑僇女，無有攸赦。」以告令師，作湯誓。於是湯曰：「吾甚武」，號曰武王。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"夏桀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000076","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"昆吾氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0021","start":21,"end":22,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"昆吾","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000076","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0149","start":149,"end":151,"surface":"夏王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0250","start":250,"end":251,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m007-0261","start":261,"end":263,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本段明示湯號武王，不連到周武王。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p008","text":"桀敗於有娀之虛，桀犇於鳴條，夏師敗績。湯遂伐三㚇，俘厥寶玉，義伯、仲伯作典寶。湯既勝夏，欲遷其社，不可，作夏社。伊尹報。於是諸侯畢服，湯乃踐天子位，平定海內。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000076","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"桀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000076","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"義伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000097","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"仲伯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000098","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m008-0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p009","text":"湯歸至于泰卷陶，中𤳹作誥。既絀夏命，還亳，作湯誥：「維三月，王自至於東郊。告諸侯群后：『毋不有功於民，勤力迺事。予乃大罰殛女，毋予怨。』曰：『古禹、皋陶久勞于外，其有功乎民，民乃有安。東為江，北為濟，西為河，南為淮，四瀆已修，萬民乃有居。后稷降播，農殖百穀。三公咸有功于民，故后有立。昔蚩尤與其大夫作亂百姓，帝乃弗予，有狀。先王言不可不勉。』曰：『不道，毋之在國，女毋我怨。』」以令諸侯。伊尹作咸有一德，咎單作明居。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"中𤳹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000099","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0030","start":30,"end":31,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"只依本段對話的君主與事件暫定，不作全篇通用的帝／王匹配。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0072","start":72,"end":73,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000043","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"皋陶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000044","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0119","start":119,"end":121,"surface":"后稷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000046","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"三公","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0143","start":143,"end":145,"surface":"蚩尤","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000003","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0154","start":154,"end":158,"surface":"帝乃弗予","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0162","start":162,"end":164,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、官稱或未定個人指代；不由熟知故事補出姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0194","start":194,"end":196,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m009-0202","start":202,"end":204,"surface":"咎單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000100","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p011","text":"湯崩，太子太丁未立而卒，於是迺立太丁之弟外丙，是為帝外丙。帝外丙即位三年，崩，立外丙之弟中壬，是為帝中壬。帝中壬即位四年，崩，伊尹迺立太丁之子太甲。太甲，成湯適長孫也，是為帝太甲。帝太甲元年，伊尹作伊訓，作肆命，作徂后。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"太丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000101","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"太丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000101","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000102","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"帝外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000102","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0029","start":29,"end":32,"surface":"帝外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000102","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"外丙","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000102","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"中壬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000103","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"帝中壬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000103","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0053","start":53,"end":56,"surface":"帝中壬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000103","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"太丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000101","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"成湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0086","start":86,"end":89,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0090","start":90,"end":93,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m011-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p012","text":"帝太甲既立三年，不明，暴虐，不遵湯法，亂德，於是伊尹放之於桐宮。三年，伊尹攝行政當國，以朝諸侯。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m012-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p013","text":"帝太甲居桐宮三年，悔過自責，反善，於是伊尹迺迎帝太甲而授之政。帝太甲修德，諸侯咸歸殷，百姓以寧。伊尹嘉之，迺作太甲訓三篇，襃帝太甲，稱太宗。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0031","start":31,"end":34,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0062","start":62,"end":65,"surface":"帝太甲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m013-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"太宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:p014","text":"太宗崩，子沃丁立。帝沃丁之時，伊尹卒。既葬伊尹於亳，咎單遂訓伊尹事，作沃丁。","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"太宗","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000104","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"沃丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000105","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"帝沃丁","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000105","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"咎單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000100","status":"source_identified"},{"id":"c-shiji-003-yin:m014-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"source_identified"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","book_id":"b-shiji-003","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p002","text":"其在成王時，召王爲三公：自陜以西，召公主之；自陜以東，周公主之。成王旣幼，周公攝政，當國踐祚，召公疑之，作君奭。君奭不説周公。周公乃稱「湯時有伊尹，假于皇天；在太戊時，則有若伊陟、臣扈，假于上帝，巫咸治王家；在祖乙時，則有若巫賢；在武丁時，則有若甘般：率維茲有陳，保乂有殷」。於是召公乃説。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000155","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"召王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"召公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000184","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000156","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000155","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000156","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"召公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000184","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0052","start":52,"end":55,"surface":"作君奭","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"君奭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000184","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000156","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"周公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000156","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000077","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000094","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"皇天","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m002-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"太戊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000109